        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-715-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH716-ADV-PROC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH717-ISA-DECODE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH718-PROC-LAT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH719-720M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
